            "title": "Freedom上調BP評級，油價上漲推動季度業績強勁",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"Freedom上調BP評級，油價上漲推動季度業績強勁\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/452a867d67f067a1152db0b18c647057e344a12070d68e3684d957f84e7e9945/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fi-invdn-com.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA6U04V_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">Freedom上調BP評級，油價上漲推動季度業績強勁</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 英國石油巨頭英國石油公司（BP plc）股票獲Freedom Broker將評級由「賣出」上調至「持有」。該公司2026年第二季度調整後每ADR攤薄每股盈利為2.22美元，超出市場共識預期13.8%，主要受油氣價格上漲帶動，收入按年大增48.2%至69.1億美元，促使該券商將目標價由39美元上調至43美元（每ADR）。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Freedom Broker高級分析師謝爾蓋·皮加列夫（Sergey Pigarev）提醒，此次亮眼表現在很大程度上屬於短暫現象。他表示：「BP第二季度的超預期表現主要由短暫性因素驅動。」他將此次業績主要歸因於中東衝突持續及俄羅斯煉油產能損失所帶來的油氣價格高企。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-3186aa63-c26b-3e8a-afb7-833c9d9c7ad4-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">本季度調整後淨利潤達57億美元，較去年同期的24億美元大幅增長，並按季環比上升79.2%。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">天然氣及低碳能源業務板塊的平均實現價格按年上升29.3%至每桶52.8美元；石油生產板塊的平均實現價格則上漲26.8%至每桶62.2美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">客戶及產品業務板塊的經營利潤按年增長逾兩倍，達50億美元，煉油利潤率攀升至每桶29.6美元，按年大漲148.7%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">扣除營運資本變動前的經營現金流按季環比增長52.2%至135億美元，惟因支付與墨西哥灣漏油事件相關的11億美元賠款，現金流有所減少。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">儘管營運資本增加27億美元，本季度淨債務仍下降29億美元至355億美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">產量方面有所下滑。天然氣及低碳能源業務板塊產量按年下降2.1%至每日77萬桶油當量，石油生產板塊產量則下降5.4%至每日144萬桶油當量。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">管理層預計第三季度產量將進一步下降1.2%，原因包括中東衝突持續及計劃性維護；此外，隨著蓋爾森基興（Gelsenkirchen）煉油廠完成出售，煉油吞吐量或將下跌約9%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">資本支出按年下降8.2%至31億美元，管理層指引2026年全年資本支出約為135億美元，低於2025年的145億美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">董事會批准將季度股息提高4.1%至每ADR 0.52美元，按當前股價47.38美元計算，年化股息收益率約為5.0%。除息日為8月14日，派息日定於9月18日。本季度未進行任何股份購回。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Freedom Broker採用五年期自由現金流折現模型（基於公司自由現金流）釐定43美元的目標價，相對前收盤價41.21美元，隱含回報率為4.34%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">皮加列夫警告，BP計劃於2026年出售90億至100億美元資產，此舉構成下行風險，因為相關資產出售將攤薄公司的收入及盈利。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/freedom%E4%B8%8A%E8%AA%BFbp%E8%A9%95%E7%B4%9A-%E6%B2%B9%E5%83%B9%E4%B8%8A%E6%BC%B2%E6%8E%A8%E5%8B%95%E5%AD%A3%E5%BA%A6%E6%A5%AD%E7%B8%BE%E5%BC%B7%E5%8B%81-110711164.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-07 19:28:55",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "財經｜華僑銀行上半年淨利創新高　中期息增15%至47仙",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"財經｜華僑銀行上半年淨利創新高　中期息增15%至47仙\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/49b0d0ce980e8683d284f9ba2e12c935cf1463332015d8c1421a6fba516afa28/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">財經｜華僑銀行上半年淨利創新高　中期息增15%至47仙</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">華僑銀行公布，2026年上半年淨利按年增長13%，創紀錄達41.9億坡元。總收入升11%至80億坡元，主要受非利息收入強勁增長帶動，抵銷了減息環境下淨利息收入的跌幅。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">期內非利息收入按年急升36%，收費、交易及保險收入均創新高。成本收入比率改善至38.5%，貸款及存款持續增加；資產質素亦保持穩健，不良貸款比率維持0.9%，不良資產撥備覆蓋率為163%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">集團年化每股盈利升至1.86坡元，年化股本回報率增至13.7%。董事會宣布派發中期普通股息每股47仙，按年增加6仙或15%，相當於期內淨利約五成。華僑銀行表示，將繼續推進早前公布的25億坡元資本回報計劃，目標於今年內完成。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-5bfbbc94-8a61-323e-bba3-ead3ebd703eb-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
